{"term": {"label": "信", "variants": []}, "source": {"id": "1B", "url": "https://ctext.org/mengzi/liang-hui-wang-ii", "title": "梁惠王下", "description": "莊暴見孟子，曰：「暴見於王，王語暴以好樂，暴未有以對也。」曰：「好樂何如？」\n孟子曰：「王之好樂甚，則齊國其庶幾乎！」\n他日，見於王曰：「王嘗語莊子以好樂，有諸？」王變乎色，曰：「寡人非能好先王之樂也，直好世俗之樂耳。」\n曰：「王之好樂甚，則齊其庶幾乎！今之樂猶古之樂也。」曰：「可得聞與？」\n曰：「獨樂樂，與人樂樂，孰", "occurrences": 1, "data": null}, "network": {"directed": false, "multigraph": false, "graph": {}, "nodes": [{"form": "下", "id": "下"}, {"form": "侯", "id": "侯"}, {"form": "保", "id": "保"}, {"form": "信", "id": "信"}, {"form": "天", "id": "天"}, {"form": "安", "id": "安"}, {"form": "居", "id": "居"}, {"form": "山", "id": "山"}, {"form": "巡", "id": "巡"}, {"form": "怒", "id": "怒"}, {"form": "憂", "id": "憂"}, {"form": "殘", "id": "殘"}, {"form": "水", "id": "水"}, {"form": "畏", "id": "畏"}, {"form": "職", "id": "職"}, {"form": "述", "id": "述"}], "edges": [{"weight": 1.7884205679625405, "source": "居", "target": "下"}, {"weight": 3.6855405528484217, "source": "居", "target": "山"}, {"weight": 1.6060990111685858, "source": "憂", "target": "下"}, {"weight": 1.466337068793427, "source": "憂", "target": "天"}, {"weight": 2.6559211356672634, "source": "憂", "target": "侯"}, {"weight": 1.6060990111685858, "source": "殘", "target": "下"}, {"weight": 2.299246191728531, "source": "山", "target": "下"}, {"weight": 1.7884205679625405, "source": "怒", "target": "下"}, {"weight": 1.6486586255873816, "source": "怒", "target": "天"}, {"weight": 3.6855405528484217, "source": "怒", "target": "安"}, {"weight": 1.6060990111685858, "source": "保", "target": "下"}, {"weight": 2.159484249353372, "source": "保", "target": "天"}, {"weight": 2.9923933722884763, "source": "保", "target": "畏"}, {"weight": 3.061386243775428, "source": "職", "target": "侯"}, {"weight": 1.8718021769015913, "source": "職", "target": "天"}, {"weight": 5.0072963928307415, "source": "職", "target": "述"}, {"weight": 2.7047112998366956, "source": "信", "target": "下"}, {"weight": 2.5649493574615367, "source": "信", "target": "天"}, {"weight": 2.341805806147327, "sourc